ckages/pi-lhc/test/inference/closed-loop.test.ts:90-143.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"SV-05-004\",\n        \"status\": \"resolved\",\n        \"rationale\": \"TC-4.4 now covers both halves: host returns ok:true with empty text for empty completion, and the LHC adapter records empty_output through inspect health. Evidence: packages/pi-lhc/test/inference/model-call.test.ts:235-310.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"SV-05-005\",\n        \"status\": \"resolved\",\n        \"rationale\": \"the concurrency risk test now holds the first smoothed derivation result, edits the source message to queue version 2, releases the stale result, drains, and asserts sourceVersion 2 content landed while stale text did not. Evidence: packages/pi-lhc/test/inference/closed-loop.test.ts:147-228.\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"newFindings\": [],\n    \"openFindings\": [],\n    \"requirementCoverage\": {\n      \"verified\": [\n        \"AC-4.1/TC-4.1: default initialization injects createModelCall(ctx), and model-call test verifies registry resolution, auth, exact completion text, and message passing.\",\n        \"AC-4.2/TC-4.2: provider/model keys are routed through modelRegistry.find, and closed-loop assigns different derivation kinds to success/failure lanes in one session.\",\n        \"AC-4.3/TC-4.3: failure classification for auth, invalid_request, rate_limit, timeout, network, and thrown/unknown values is covered, with createModelCall catch returning classified failures.\",\n        \"AC-4.4/TC-4.4: host returns empty text as success and the LHC adapter records empty_output for empty resolved output.\",\n        \"AC-4.5/TC-4.5: captured thread work drains through the scheduler and persists both ready and classified failed outcomes queryable through inspect health/overview.\",\n        \"Architecture-Risk: Concurrency / Lost Update: stale background result is forced and verified not to clobber newer edited state.\",\n        \"Configured gates passed: pnpm --filter pi-lhc verify and pnpm --filter pi-lhc verify-all.\"\n      ],\n      \"unverified\": []\n    },\n    \"gatesRun\": [\n      {\n        \"command\": \"pnpm --filter pi-lhc verify\",\n        \"result\": \"pass\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"command\": \"pnpm --filter pi-lhc verify-all\",\n        \"result\": \"pass\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"productionPathFindings\": [],\n    \"recommendedNextStep\": \"pass\",\n    \"recommendedFixScope\": \"same-session-implementor\",\n    \"openQuestions\": [],\n    \"additionalObservations\": [\n      \"Production-path audit found no remaining mockComplete, placeholder completion text, or observeOnlyProvider default in the Story 5 connector runtime path; remaining fake ModelCalls are confined to tests.\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"errors\": [],\n  \"warnings\": [],\n  \"artifacts\": [\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"result-envelope\",\n      \"path\": \"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/05-inference-host-routing/008-verify.json\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"startedAt\": \"2026-06-14T13:03:06.899Z\",\n  \"finishedAt\": \"2026-06-14T13:04:50.351Z\"\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
